# RE = Read Email (Fall # watch — click-gated auto-RE)

**Chat scope:** **Email processing agent chat only** (startup: `EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`). Instructions dashboard must **not** run this script — see `.cursor/rules/instructions-only-no-re-pr-lf.mdc`.

**Always stick to the processing form:** Use the full 7-step output structure from **sprinklr-read-answer-email** SKILL.md.

**AI model (ABSOLUTE):** Model picker stays **Auto**. **Grok is banned.**

## Click-gated Fall # watch (default)

On session **`go`**, start the watch script in background. It does **not** poll Fall # until the user **left-clicks** a sidebar case button:

`button[data-testid="collapsed-case-item"]`  
(e.g. `aria-label="Fall Nr. 55901259 von Andreas Doub"`)

### Flow per case

1. Script prints **`FALL_WATCH_ARMED`** — waiting for case-item click (no Fall # polling yet).
2. User **left-clicks** a collapsed case item → **`CASE_ITEM_CLICK_DETECTED`**.
3. Script polls h1 Fall # (`h1[data-spaceweb="typography-h2"] span[data-testid="box"]`) until it **changes** to the clicked case.
4. **`FALL_CHANGE_DETECTED`** → extract email → **`FALL_DETECTION_STOPPED`** (polling ends for this click).
5. **You** immediately output full **7-step RE**.
6. Script waits for **next** case-item click (repeat from step 1).

User does **not** type **RE** between cases — only **clicks** the next case in Sprinklr.

### Session start (`go`)

1. Login if needed (`login-command.mdc`).
2. Start watch in **background**:
   ```powershell
   Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py
   ```
3. Tell user: **click a case** in the Sprinklr sidebar to trigger read — no RE typing needed.

**Do not ask for confirmation** — start watch on **go** automatically.

### **RE** / **re** (optional alias)

Ensure watch script is running if not already.

### Legacy single-shot

**RE once**: `uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --once`

## 7-step output (unchanged)

On **`FALL_CHANGE_DETECTED` + CUSTOMER EMAIL** → sections 1–7 immediately.

## Integrity

- Discard prior Fall # context on each `FALL_CHANGE_DETECTED`.
- PR pastes latest RE for the **same visible Fall #** only.

## Stop watch

Ctrl+C in watch terminal, or user says **stop watch**.
